	(text "Controller: original ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1-N16R8 v1.1 in socket U501 (pin 1 of J1 and J3 marked; antenna end and USB end on silkscreen). +3V3 = DevKit LDO output only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f5340fc0-f9e9-58e1-a48f-caea73453bff")
	)
	(text "5 V: carrier +5V -> D501 -> DevKit 5V pin. With the DevKit USB diodes this is a diode-OR: USB and battery may be connected at the same time; USB never feeds carrier rails (replaces JP101)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 35.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5f983a93-6f64-5e6f-8ece-4cf6653232d4")
	)
	(text "Defaults with ESP32 in reset, booting or missing: servo rail OFF (ServoPower R414/Q404/R415), output buffers Hi-Z (R501), buzzer off, button reads high. Firmware: rail first, then ACT_OE_N low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3f3dca97-5941-551f-a54e-02c725ad7ef3")
	)
	(text "O-21: U504 (TLV809E) sets P3V3_OK only while +3V3 >= 2.93 V; it closes the divider switches Q505/Q405 and enables +5V_EXT. BAT54 clamps hold ADC pins <= VDD + 0.24 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "dd385b99-58c2-5ba1-ab96-1405baba4c3b")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
